Product Brief: AI study buddy
Executive Summary
AI Study Buddy is an application that helps students turn their own lecture notes, slides,
and study materials into useful learning resources. Students upload their material, choose
language and receive summaries, flashcards, quizzes and key concepts.
The problem is not a lack of information, but the time and effort required to process large
amounts of study material. AI Study Buddy makes this process faster and more structured
while helping students learn practical ways to use AI for text processing and studying.
The Problem
Students often have large amounts of notes and lecture slides but limited time to process
them. Creating summaries, flashcards, and practice questions manually is time-
consuming, while generic AI tools may produce overly broad answers or content that is
difficult to verify. The results is that students spend their time doing less work getting
quizes ready and more time actually working with their meterial
The Solution
AI Study Buddy provides a simple workflow:
Upload > Generate > Study
Students can upload PDF or text-based material and receive:
-Concise or detailed summaries.
-Flashcards for active recall.
-Quiz questions and answers.
-References to relevant pages or sections where possible.
The product focuses on helping students process their own notes into quizzes
What Makes This Different
> Uses the student's own course material.
> Generates multiple learning formats from the same source.
> Offers simple controls for language and detail.
> Provides source references to improve trust and verification.
> Gives students hands-on experience using AI responsibly.
The initial advantage is likely to be simplicity and execution.
Who This Serves
Primary users will be students off all kinds. (pref higher level students)
This server anyone that has notes or course material they want to turn into working
quizzes. They need to qoickly understand what matters, organize their material, and test
their knowlede.
Success is when students move from “ i have too much material and don’t know where to
start” to “i have a clear overview and can start practicing”
Success Criteria
70%+ of users who upload material generate at least one learning resource.
60%+ use generated flashcards or quizzes for active study.
70%+ report that the product makes their material easier to process.
Most users can go from upload to their first learning resource within two minutes,
excluding processing time.
Product Success
High completion rate from upload to generated content.
Repeat usage with new course material.
Low error rate for PDF/text processing.
Scope
In — MVP
The first version focuses on one core workflow:
Upload study material → generate learning resources.
Included:
PDF and text uploads.
Course/subject and language selection.
Adjustable summary detail.
Summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and key concepts.
Out — MVP
Automatic grading.
University-system integrations.
Advanced learning analytics.
Complex interpretation of diagrams and figures.
Vision
The long-term goal is simple: help students process, understand, and actively practice
their own curriculum while becoming more capable and responsible users of AI
